{% from "../components/picture/picture.nunj" import picture %}

<section class="climbing-hero community-hero page__community-hero">
	<h1 class="community-hero__title h2 ttu _anim-first" data-animation='words'>
		<span class="word-wrapper"><span class="word">Скалодром</span></span>
	</h1>
	<p class="community-hero__text p1 _anim-first" data-animation='fade-right'>Встречайте&nbsp;&mdash; наш скалодром на&nbsp;Пролетарской для всех и&nbsp;каждого! Теперь в&nbsp;Москве стало на&nbsp;одно отличное место для тренировок и&nbsp;отдыха больше&nbsp;&mdash; мы&nbsp;открыли новый современный скалодром.</p>
	{{ picture({
		className: 'community-hero__img',
		path: '/assets/images/community/climbing/climbing-hero',
		ext: 'webp',
		width: 703,
		height: 836,
		isSimple: true,
		attr: 'aria-hidden="true"'
	}) }}
	<div class="climbing-hero__signup community-hero__link">
		<span class="climbing-hero__signup-title h5 ttu">Записаться<br> на&nbsp;тренировку</span>
		<div class="climbing-hero__signup-socials">
			<a href="https://t.me/Alpindustria_ru" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="climbing-hero__signup-link button _white-border _social-l _tg h4 ttu" aria-label="Telegram">TG</a>
			<a href="https://vk.com/alpindustria_ru" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="climbing-hero__signup-link button _white-border _social-l _vk h4 ttu" aria-label="VK">VK</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
